WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Greece is considered the cradle of Western civilization, democracy, philosophy, and the Olympic Games.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mount Olympus rises to 2,918 meters, historically revered as the mythological home of the gods.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
In Athens, the Parthenon on the rocky Acropolis citadel exemplifies Classical Doric architecture.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Greek music resonates through the metallic strings of the Bouzouki and energetic Syrtaki dance.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Culinary highlights include layered Moussaka with eggplant, crisp Greek salad with Feta, and Souvlaki.

